        "node_id": "n_1_4ca130",
        "thought_text": "The error in the code is due to the use of the `sortedcontainers` module, which is not available in the execution environment. To avoid this issue, we should implement our own data structure to efficiently manage the fogs and nets. We can use a list of tuples to represent the fogs and nets, and sort them based on their coordinates. This approach will allow us to efficiently check for overlaps and calculate the missed fogs without relying on external libraries.",
