        "node_id": "n_5_5724e3",
        "thought_text": "Thought-2: The error in the code is due to the assumption that fogs are generated in order of appearance, which may not always be the case. To fix this, we need to sort all fogs by their appearance day and process them in that order. This ensures that we account for all fogs, regardless of their generation sequence.",
